OL,3,GNEWSAMarathon runner Radcliffe collects
OL,4,Aroyal honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FChampion runner Paula Radcliffe has
OL,7,Fsaid it was an "immense honour" to be
OL,8,Fappointed OBE.
OL,10,FThe Prince of Wales presented the medal
OL,11,Fto the three-time London Marathon
OL,12,Fwinner at Tuesday's investiture
OL,13,Fceremony at Windsor Castle as she
OL,14,Fbecame an Officer of the Order of the
OL,15,FBritish Empire for services to sport.
OL,17,FRadcliffe, who was born in Cheshire but
OL,18,Fmoved to the village of Oakley in
OL,19,FBedfordshire when she was 12, praised
OL,20,FPrincess Charlotte for helping to
OL,21,Finspire girls to take up sport.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
